<title>USA: IMM currency futures end mixed, yen up strongly.</title>
<headline>IMM currency futures end mixed, yen up strongly.</headline>
<text>
<p>May 15 - IMM currencies ended mixed with yen futures up strongly. Traders said expectations for higher Japan rates, short yen unwinding dominate market. Rubin repeats strong dollar in U.S. best interests. June Canadian dollar at 7-week high. Trading heavy across the board, traders said.</p>
<p>E-mail:derivatives@reuters.com</p>
